# Each line defines a mapping rule: <device_path> <input_type> <code> <target_type> <target_code>
# Supported input types: EV_KEY (key), EV_ABS (absolute axis), EV_REL (relative axis)
# Supported target types: EV_KEY (key), EV_ABS (axis), EV_REL (relative), or special: CLEAR, IGNORE, SYNC, NOP
